---
import ProgressiveBlur from '@pzhown/ui/astro'
import ComponentShowcase from '../components/ComponentShowcase'
import '../styles/global.css'
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="description" content="PzHown iOS 27 Web design system" />
    <title>PzHown · iOS 27 UI</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="page-shell">
      <section class="hero">
        <p class="hero-kicker">PZHOWN / iOS 27 DESIGN SYSTEM</p>
        <h1>从组件结构开始，重新做一遍。</h1>
        <p>外观严格以 ios27-design-system 为基准；组件 anatomy 借鉴 react-cupertino-ui，但实现、状态与样式归 PzHown 自己所有。旧 shadcn / aria-nova 视觉组件已退出。</p>
        <div class="hero-links">
          <a class="ios27-btn ios27-btn--filled ios27-btn--medium" href="/components">查看组件</a>
          <a class="ios27-btn ios27-btn--glass ios27-btn--medium" href="https://github.com/PzHown/pzhown_dot_cn">GitHub</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="lab-section">
        <header class="section-heading"><div><h2>过渡渐变</h2></div><p>保留原有 Oklab + smootherstep 渐变能力，不把它与 iOS 27 组件视觉耦合。</p></header>
        <div class="gradient-grid">
          <article class="gradient-card gradient-oklab" style="--gradient-angle:135deg;--gradient-from:oklch(0.72 0.2 250);--gradient-to:oklch(0.74 0.2 335);color:white"><div><strong>Oklab</strong><span>Perceptual interpolation</span></div></article>
          <article class="gradient-card gradient-smooth" style="--gradient-angle:135deg;--gradient-from:oklch(0.86 0.16 95);--gradient-to:oklch(0.68 0.21 25);color:#3b1b00"><div><strong>Smootherstep</strong><span>Soft acceleration at both ends</span></div></article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="lab-section">
        <header class="section-heading"><div><h2>Progressive Blur</h2></div><p>保留原有分层 mask + backdrop-filter 实现，用于滚动边缘和上下文过渡，不作为组件皮肤。</p></header>
        <div class="blur-stage">
          <div class="blur-content">Progressive Blur</div>
          <ProgressiveBlur mode="linear" side="bottom" strength={48} steps={8} falloff={72} />
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="lab-section">
        <header class="section-heading"><div><h2>iOS 27 Core</h2></div><p>按钮、输入、选择、列表、浮层与系统 Chrome 都是新实现。</p></header>
        <ComponentShowcase client:load />
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
